Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.40,0:00:06.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let me tell you a story about my past.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.74,0:00:09.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was back when I was in sixth grade.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.55,0:00:16.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One of the girls in my class brought a box\Nwith around seven or eight hamsters to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.57,0:00:20.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She'd carelessly let them breed...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.03,0:00:23.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and had no idea what to do \Nsince she couldn't keep them all.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.38,0:00:29.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I took them home, \Nfilled a large wine bottle with water,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.70,0:00:31.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and dropped them all in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.65,0:00:36.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I returned to my room\Nafter dinner three hours later,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.04,0:00:38.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was fascinated by what I saw.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.37,0:00:46.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One of the hamsters had managed to stay alive\Nby standing on the other lifeless corpses.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.87,0:00:48.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It honestly gave me goosebumps.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.41,0:00:52.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I decided to keep it and named it Spice.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.31,0:00:59.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What I saw reminded me of\Nthe short story, "The Spider's Thread."
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.03,0:01:00.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have you heard of it?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.32,0:01:04.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A sinner named Kandata was a cold-blooded\Ncriminal who'd been sent to Hell,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.88,0:01:09.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he had performed one act of compassion\Nin his life by sparing a spider's life.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.14,0:01:12.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Moved by it, Buddha lowers \Na spider's thread from Paradise to Hell.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.89,0:01:15.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kandata begins climbing it to Paradise,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.97,0:01:21.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he kicks off all the other sinners\Nwho tried to follow him.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.44,0:01:26.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At that moment, the thread breaks, \Ncasting him back down to the depths of Hell.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.62,0:01:33.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You might not believe this, but I'll tell you anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.02,0:01:36.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Actually, you might understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.48,0:01:38.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ever since I met Spice,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.33,0:01:42.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've started seeing spider's threads\Nevery now and then.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've killed anyone I've seen \Nwith one dangling above their head.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.80,0:01:51.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But this one time, a boy foiled my plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.30,0:01:55.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then, a spider's thread \Nappeared above his head, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.10,0:01:58.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.01,0:02:01.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know what lies in your future!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.67,0:02:06.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the boy didn't die.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.36,0:02:11.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I named him Spice and decided to observe him.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.24,0:02:16.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's you, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.67,0:03:53.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That will be 987 yen.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.55,0:04:48.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to think of it, \Ndidn't Satoru mention this one time?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.11,0:04:54.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can actually take a direct train to Ueno.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.55,0:04:56.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's true.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.45,0:04:59.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just why did he say that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.47,0:05:54.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Satoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.06,0:06:05.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is quite remarkable.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.40,0:06:07.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't seem like you spent\Nfifteen years in a coma.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.22,0:06:11.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fifteen... years...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.77,0:06:13.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, you can speak already?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.74,0:06:16.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like you'll be able \Nto begin rehabilitation soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.67,0:06:26.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For fifteen whole years, Mom spent \Nfour hours every day taking care of my body.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.54,0:06:30.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And for the last three years,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.47,0:06:35.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she's been using something called \Nan EMS device to prepare for the day I woke up.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She kept my joints and muscles in shape.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.29,0:06:47.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was 139 cm tall back in fifth grade,\Nbut now I am 169 cm tall.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.98,0:06:51.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dr. Kitamura kept alternating between\N"This is all thanks to your mother"
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.65,0:06:54.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and "I can't believe this" over and over.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right, Satoru-kun. I think it's about time.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Answer this question.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.25,0:07:06.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's the last thing you remember\Nfrom before you fell into the coma?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The last thing I remember...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.52,0:07:16.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.48,0:07:18.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.24,0:07:20.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}What happened, again?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.15,0:07:28.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those memories had been\N locked up tightly behind a closed door.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.83,0:07:32.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to see yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.25,0:07:37.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're taking it in stride, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.31,0:07:42.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, your face must look a lot different\Nfrom when you were eleven.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.43,0:07:45.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But well, considering how \Nyour memories are all jumbled up,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.21,0:07:48.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,maybe you're still having trouble\Nzeroing in on your own identity.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.79,0:07:52.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At first, I accepted his words at face value,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.78,0:07:56.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the term "Heisei era", \Nwhich I should've never seen before,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.72,0:07:59.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}didn't seem at all unfamiliar.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.68,0:08:00.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Endure."
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.64,0:08:01.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Heart rate monitor."
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.85,0:08:03.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Feeling of loss."
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.20,0:08:04.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Arbitration."
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.14,0:08:09.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can read all these words.\NJust when did I learn them?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.33,0:08:12.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.04,0:08:18.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.95,0:08:21.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.32,0:08:24.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You have visitors.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.79,0:08:26.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.14,0:08:28.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You seem well, Satoru-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.62,0:08:34.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kobayashi Kenya and Sugita Hiromi \Nwere two classmates of mine I was close to.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.14,0:08:38.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kenya had become a lawyer, and Hiromi a doctor.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.30,0:08:41.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had fun talking to them \Nabout the most pointless things.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.02,0:08:46.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kenya looked like he wanted to ask me something,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.28,0:08:49.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I think Mom had told him to tread carefully.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So we ended up just chatting that day.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.23,0:08:55.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.19,0:08:56.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.65,0:09:02.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There were a lot of questions\NI wanted to ask them, too,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.37,0:09:06.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it seemed like Mom was trying to\Nprevent me from talking about my past.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.66,0:09:10.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mom had been living solely\Nfor my sake for fifteen years,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.91,0:09:13.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}holding onto the belief I would awaken someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.62,0:09:19.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she doesn't want me to remember,\Nthen maybe I don't have to.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.35,0:09:29.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.86,0:09:31.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we call it a day?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.26,0:09:41.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.41,0:10:05.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.30,0:10:11.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I got married. I'm Sugita Kayo now.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.55,0:10:14.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so Hiromi's the father?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.31,0:10:15.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.02,0:10:18.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I knew he wanted to say something to me.\NI guess it was about you and your child.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.99,0:10:19.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.96,0:10:22.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, \Nthe baby has Hiromi's long eyelashes.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.99,0:10:25.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, even though he's a boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.89,0:10:27.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,His name's Mirai.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mirai... "Future," huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.05,0:10:30.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's a great name.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.23,0:10:33.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.74,0:10:39.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly, we didn't know if it was right\Nfor us to find happiness by ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.38,0:10:44.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, it could've been our fault\Nthat you ended up in a coma.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.75,0:10:45.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It kind of felt like...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.72,0:10:49.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,we were leaving you behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.98,0:10:54.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo, I hold my fate in my own hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.10,0:10:56.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to feel guilty about anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.81,0:11:00.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I am who I am right now\Nas a result of my own choices.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.48,0:11:06.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,For a guy who spent fifteen years in a coma,\Nyou've still got a way with words.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.44,0:11:11.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But you know what, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.34,0:11:14.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Before, I could only ever picture\Na life of solitude for myself,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.82,0:11:16.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but now I have a family to call my own.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.27,0:11:19.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And it's all because you were there for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.61,0:11:20.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.02,0:11:23.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Thank you," huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.49,0:11:27.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.73,0:11:32.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There, there! Hungry, are we?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.30,0:11:34.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.11,0:11:45.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.67,0:11:46.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.62,0:11:48.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry for springing all this on you at once.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.86,0:11:50.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Must've worn you out.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.79,0:11:53.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bye. I'll come visit you again.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.24,0:11:55.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure. Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.36,0:12:14.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're back already?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.68,0:12:15.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.44,0:12:18.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki dropped by earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.43,0:12:20.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I ran into her too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.44,0:12:23.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Her baby's adorable, isn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.65,0:12:27.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Say, Mom...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.51,0:12:29.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.94,0:12:32.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're here again?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.91,0:12:34.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who is?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.18,0:12:37.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Gossip magazine photographers.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.55,0:12:41.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They want to cover your story now that\Nyou've awoken from a fifteen-year coma.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.14,0:12:42.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.34,0:12:45.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were saying something?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.56,0:12:48.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah. Never mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.72,0:12:50.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.64,0:12:54.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.87,0:12:56.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for doing this.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.63,0:13:02.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When will I be able to walk again, Dr. Kitamura?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.10,0:13:04.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't say. It's all up to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.53,0:13:07.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Then double my rehab regimen from today.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.57,0:13:10.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to walk outside as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.45,0:13:13.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.84,0:13:15.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you, Director.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.93,0:13:20.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He's making a steady recovery.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.10,0:13:24.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He could regain his memories anytime now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.23,0:13:26.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.24,0:13:30.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Like I said the other day,\NI'll have to turn you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.23,0:13:32.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My patient isn't some guinea pig—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.47,0:13:36.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.84,0:13:41.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's great, Satoru-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.91,0:13:44.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your limbs have gotten a lot stronger.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.36,0:14:09.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Congrats, Satoru-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.47,0:14:11.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Fujinuma-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.27,0:14:12.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you went the distance!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Great job hanging in there.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.09,0:14:30.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kenya-kun's here to see you, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.61,0:14:32.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kenya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.15,0:14:34.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry for coming so late.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.22,0:14:36.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah. Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hello, Satoru-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.58,0:14:43.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I used to work with your mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.90,0:14:48.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We've met several times before\Nyou started elementary school.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.04,0:14:51.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, that was more than twenty years ago!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.76,0:14:54.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'd remember.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.89,0:15:00.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bye. I'll come again.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.28,0:15:02.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.83,0:15:08.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We've waited fifteen long years.\NWhat's the point of rushing now?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.84,0:15:10.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's take it slow and steady.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.78,0:15:11.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.59,0:15:22.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.70,0:15:26.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.06,0:15:29.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So you're having surgery in two weeks, Kumi-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.68,0:15:32.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan's giving me this "bone marrow" thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.32,0:15:34.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They say it'll cure me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.10,0:15:38.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.10,0:15:45.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is it true you were asleep for fifteen years?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.68,0:15:49.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've been here around three months, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.19,0:15:51.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.03,0:15:54.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've been doing my best \Nso I'd look good in front of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.56,0:15:57.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you're gone, I'll lose all motivation.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.10,0:16:06.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Courage...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.66,0:16:12.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Want me to teach you how to muster up courage?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.57,0:16:15.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Picture the smiles of the people you care about.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,With a smile on your face too, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.31,0:16:24.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"A drifter in time.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.23,0:16:27.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Man who wakes up after \Nfifteen-year coma still likes little girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.29,0:16:29.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Adult in body, child at heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.76,0:16:30.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He gets discharged soon!"
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.96,0:16:31.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How's that for a story?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.13,0:16:33.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.23,0:16:38.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Secretly photographing \Ncivilians on hospital grounds,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,libel, and trespassing.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.94,0:16:43.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,More than enough to get you punished by law.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.45,0:16:45.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of here right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.65,0:16:50.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That flower was really pretty.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nishizono-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.17,0:16:53.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.37,0:16:54.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kumi-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.26,0:16:59.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma Satoru-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.03,0:17:00.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.33,0:17:04.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's me. Did you forget?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.76,0:17:08.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I have changed a lot myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.55,0:17:12.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Look. I'm your homeroom teacher from fifth grade...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.73,0:17:13.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro Gaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.27,0:17:18.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I go by Nishizono now.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.10,0:17:21.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I also changed my first name to Manabu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.24,0:17:24.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you change your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.87,0:17:29.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I got married five years ago and was adopted\Ninto my wife's family as a son-in-law.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.50,0:17:34.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My father-in-law had been a city councilor for ages,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.54,0:17:36.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but he passed away three years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.54,0:17:39.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I inherited his constituency \Nand became a councilor myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.72,0:17:43.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's when I switched to the more\Ncommon reading of my name.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.92,0:17:46.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So you're a politician now?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.38,0:17:48.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm still in my first year.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.83,0:17:53.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I think you'll make for \Na fine politician, Yashiro-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.62,0:18:01.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I met Kumi-chan at a charity event for leukemia.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.23,0:18:05.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I happen to know one of this hospital's\Ndirectors, so I referred her here.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.17,0:18:06.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.12,0:18:10.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I found out that you had regained\Nconsciousness much earlier,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but it took me this long to come visit you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.83,0:18:17.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You came all the way to see me today?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.97,0:18:22.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd been eagerly waiting for you\Nto wake for fifteen years.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.58,0:18:24.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.25,0:18:27.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, we went through a lot together.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.17,0:18:30.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.77,0:18:32.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.46,0:18:37.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You haven't regained all your memories yet, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.92,0:18:39.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can regain them one step at a time.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.06,0:19:21.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.96,0:19:25.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yashiro-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going to see Kumi-chan too?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.16,0:19:29.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. I heard that her surgery's\Nthe day after tomorrow,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.66,0:19:32.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so today's the last day she can have visitors.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.53,0:19:35.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I just saw her myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.04,0:19:38.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That said, she was fast asleep, so I couldn't talk to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.54,0:19:40.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.25,0:19:42.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should come back later, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.55,0:19:46.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Since you're here, mind chatting for a bit?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.09,0:19:49.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure, but we don't want\Nthe paparazzi interrupting us.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.78,0:19:51.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go someplace quieter?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.02,0:19:56.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,In fact, I know the perfect place.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.61,0:20:05.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You didn't know about this elevator, did you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.54,0:20:09.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is a bit like an adventure, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.84,0:20:19.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Press the roof button for me, would you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.49,0:20:40.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.29,0:20:44.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,On a clear day, we'd get to see a beautiful\Nsunset from here right about now.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.69,0:20:48.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Still, no sketchy photographers will come up here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.68,0:20:52.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This place is technically off-limits,\Nso keep this a secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.07,0:21:00.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Reminds me of how you, Kenya, Hiromi, and the rest\Nalways talked about going to your secret "hideout."
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.36,0:21:02.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.00,0:21:09.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've regained...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.85,0:21:11.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,my memories!

